      "sourceTextSha256": "72e234d983c7925de7b5b045a14a658b00a4769634479468596f5075583e353c",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Depart for an unforgettable cultural experience with an Emberá indigenous community in the Chagres area.\n\nTravel by traditional canoe through the rainforest before arriving at the community. Learn about the Emberá way of life, traditions and close relationship with the surrounding forest.\n\nDuring the visit, discover traditional music and dances, handicrafts, local cuisine and ancestral knowledge of medicinal plants. After lunch and the cultural activities, continue to Gamboa and check in at the hotel",
